<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:58:51 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Fidelidade 计划于 2027 年下半年在里斯本首次公开募股</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/fidelidade-said-to-aim-for-lisbon-ipo-from-second-half-of-2027</link><description>据知情人士透露，Fidelidade – Companhia de Seguros SA 正准备最早于 2027 年下半年在里斯本进行首次公开募股。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/fidelidade-said-to-aim-for-lisbon-ipo-from-second-half-of-2027'&gt;Fidelidade 计划于 2027 年下半年在里斯本首次公开募股&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Fidelidade Said to Aim for Lisbon IPO From Second Half of 2027&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/fidelidade-said-to-aim-for-lisbon-ipo-from-second-half-of-2027</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:25:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</link><description>德意志交易所股份公司 (Deutsche Boerse AG) 以 53 亿欧元（58 亿美元）收购 Allfunds Group Plc 的交易已获得欧盟无条件批准，为这家德国交易所运营商历史上最大的收购铺平了道路。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval'&gt;德意志交易所 53 亿欧元的 Allfunds 交易获得欧盟批准&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Deutsche Boerse’s €5.3 billion Allfunds Deal Gets EU Approval&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/deutsche-boerse-s-5-3-billion-allfunds-deal-gets-eu-approval</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</link><description>一项可能重塑全球烟草业的三方协议也可能波及另一个其产品有时与香烟一起消费的行业——啤酒。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake'&gt;奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria’s Interest in Imperial May Affect Its AB InBev Stake&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:14:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Drives Biggest Stock Gain Since 2024 With Rare Midday Vow&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>